    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Brainrot Royale! Fight with the greatest brainrot characters to the death in Ohio in the ultimate Gen Z showdown. Embrace chaos and claim your crown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brainrot Battle Royale is a 16 player battle royale experience, where you must fight for survival on the island of Ohio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parachute in on Bombardiro Crocodilo, loot up, and get to fighting.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated servers\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person shooting mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 characters (Play as John Pork, lil Chuddy, Tung Tung Sahur, or Tim Cheese)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate brainrot experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous map with 8 different POI's to explore</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST PACED, FPS BRAINROT GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448360/extras/e65e19de4ba032831213f953c24b110e.avif?t=1753288456\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a04 DIFFERENT CHARACTERS EACH WITH 2 UNIQUE ABILITIES<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448360/extras/37e5268fef17cd7f0677d8b886b3e8a2.avif?t=1753288456\" data-has-big width=1600 height=862 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GORGEOUS MAP WITH 8 DIFFERENT POI'S</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448360/extras/0bddd6988dbf74a8cf97393ae4f8f53f.avif?t=1753288456\" data-has-big width=1600 height=796 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IS YOUR AURA LOW IRL? JOIN THE FIGHT NOW, AND GET TO FARMING!</h2>",
